Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:56:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(nvidia): AR camera effects and demand processing

Bind installed Maxine AR face tracking and gaze redirection to the existing VFX GPU pipeline. Add bounded crop, native comparison, graphics-thread processing counters and lazy image allocation. Repair failure cleanup and partial allocations. Upstream core is unchanged; nv-filters integration is carried as a patch for the local capability audit.
